 "text": "Chariton County, Missouri home\nCOUNTY OFFICES\nASSESSOR CIRCUIT CLERK-RECORDER cIRCUIT COURT COLLECTOR-TREASURER COMMISSION CORONER COUNTY CLERK PROSECUTING ATTORNEY PUBLIC ADMINISTRATOR SHERIFF\nCONTACT US EMPLOYMENT OPPORTUNITIES communitIES\nWELCOME TO CHARITON COUNTY\nTO PAY TAXES VISIT THE COLLECTOR-TREASURER'S PAGE\nTO VIEW ELECTION NOTICES OR FINANCIAL STATEMENTS VISIT THE COUNTY CLERK'S PAGE ‍\nAbout Us\nChariton County, Missouri\nChariton County is located in the North Central portion of the State of Missouri. As of the 2020 census, the population was 7,408. It's county seat is Keytesville. The county was organized November 16, 1820 from part of Howard County and is named after the Chariton River.\nCopyright © 2023 Chariton County, Missouri. All rights reserved.",
